---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Trados.astro'
---

<Layout>
	<!-- Intro -->
	<section class="bg-background py-16 text-foreground" data-theme="default">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 lg:px-12">
			<div class="mb-8- lg:mb-16- mx-auto max-w-screen-sm text-center">
				<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight xl:text-4xl">Pricing</h2>
				<p class="text-lg/relaxed font-medium text-pretty text-foreground/80 xl:text-xl/relaxed">Used by more freelance translators than any other solution on the market, with Trados you can confidently plug into the localization supply chain and work on whatever comes your way.</p>

				<div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
					<a href="/pricing/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">New customers</a>
					<button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Existing customers</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div hidden class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between">
				<ul class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-4 rounded-full">
					<li>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center">
							<input id="currency-usd" type="radio" value="usd" name="currency" class="size-4 appearance-none rounded-full border border-foreground/15 checked:border-accent checked:before:bg-accent focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:outline-none" checked />
							<label for="currency-usd" class="pl-2 font-semibold">USD</label>
						</div>
					</li>

					<li>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center">
							<input id="currency-gbp" type="radio" value="gbp" name="currency" class="size-4 appearance-none rounded-full border border-foreground/15 checked:border-accent checked:before:bg-accent focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:outline-none" />
							<label for="currency-gbp" class="pl-2 font-semibold">GBP</label>
						</div>
					</li>

					<li>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center">
							<input id="currency-eur" type="radio" value="eur" name="currency" class="size-4 appearance-none rounded-full border border-foreground/15 checked:border-accent checked:before:bg-accent focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:outline-none" />
							<label for="currency-eur" class="pl-2 font-semibold">EUR</label>
						</div>
					</li>

					<li>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center">
							<input id="currency-jpy" type="radio" value="jpy" name="currency" class="size-4 appearance-none rounded-full border border-foreground/15 checked:border-accent checked:before:bg-accent focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:outline-none" />
							<label for="currency-jpy" class="pl-2 font-semibold">JPY</label>
						</div>
					</li>

					<li>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center">
							<input id="currency-cad" type="radio" value="cad" name="currency" class="size-4 appearance-none rounded-full border border-foreground/15 checked:border-accent checked:before:bg-accent focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:outline-none" />
							<label for="currency-cad" class="pl-2 font-semibold">CAD</label>
						</div>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Product cards -->
	<section class="bg-background pt-8 pb-8 text-foreground md:pt-12 md:pb-12 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-16" data-theme="pale">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 lg:px-12">
			<div class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-prose text-center lg:mb-16">
				<h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance xl:text-3xl">Upgrading your Studio Freelance perpetual license</h2>
				<!-- <p class="font-medium text-pretty text-foreground/80 sm:text-lg">With our subscription plans, you'll always be on the latest version of Studio, with flexible monthly and annual payment options to suit your budget.</p> -->
			</div>

			<div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
				<!-- Pricing Card -->
				<div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-card p-6 text-center text-card-foreground xl:p-10">
					<!-- <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-4 bg-linear-to-r from-tertiary via-primary to-secondary"></div> -->

					<h3 class="mt-4- mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold">Upgrade your Studio Freelance license</h3>

					<!-- <span class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-5xl font-bold">$34<span class="text-lg text-foreground/33">per month</span></span> -->

					<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground/80 md:prose-lg">
						<p>If you have a Studio Freelance 2021 or 2022 perpetual license, you can upgrade to Studio Freelance 2024.</p>
					</div>

					<a href="#" class="btn btn-tertiary btn-icon-right btn-lg mt-auto">
						Upgrade Freelance

						<!-- <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18 14v4.833A1.166 1.166 0 0 1 16.833 20H5.167A1.167 1.167 0 0 1 4 18.833V7.167A1.166 1.166 0 0 1 5.167 6h4.618m4.447-2H20v5.768m-7.889 2.121 7.778-7.778"></path>
						</svg> -->

						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><line x1="136" y1="120" x2="216" y2="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line><polyline points="216 104 215.99 40.01 152 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline><path d="M184,140v68a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H48a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V80a8,8,0,0,1,8-8h68" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></path></svg>
					</a>
				</div>

				<!-- Pricing Card -->
				<div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-card p-6 text-center text-card-foreground xl:p-10">
					<!-- <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-4 bg-linear-to-r from-tertiary via-primary to-secondary"></div> -->

					<h3 class="mt-4- mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold">Upgrade your Studio Freelance Plus license</h3>

					<!-- <span class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-5xl font-bold">$47<span class="text-lg text-foreground/33">per month</span></span> -->

					<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground/80 md:prose-lg">
						<p>If you have a Studio Freelance Plus 2021 or 2022 perpetual license, you can upgrade to Studio Freelance Plus 2024 or Studio Freelance 2024.</p>
					</div>

					<a href="#" class="btn btn-tertiary btn-icon-right btn-lg mt-8">
						Upgrade Freelance Plus

						<!-- <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18 14v4.833A1.166 1.166 0 0 1 16.833 20H5.167A1.167 1.167 0 0 1 4 18.833V7.167A1.166 1.166 0 0 1 5.167 6h4.618m4.447-2H20v5.768m-7.889 2.121 7.778-7.778"></path>
						</svg> -->

						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><line x1="136" y1="120" x2="216" y2="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></line><polyline points="216 104 215.99 40.01 152 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></polyline><path d="M184,140v68a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H48a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V80a8,8,0,0,1,8-8h68" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="24"></path></svg>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-12 text-center">
				<p class="text-sm text-foreground/50">NOTE: The upgrade path from Studio 2019 and below is no longer available. Sign-up to one of our <a href="/pricing/">subscription plans</a> to download the latest version of Studio.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Features -->
	<section class="bg-background pt-8 pb-8 text-foreground md:pt-12 md:pb-12 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-16" data-theme="default">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 lg:px-12">
			<div class="mb-8 max-w-screen-md lg:mb-16">
				<h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight xl:text-3xl">Why should you upgrade?</h2>
				<p class="font-medium text-pretty text-foreground/80 sm:text-lg">Coupled with enhanced accessibility features and improved cloud capabilities for working in the office or on the go, Studio 2024 empowers translation professionals to deliver better translations, emphasizing inclusivity and innovation. Upgrade now from Studio 2022 or 2021 and take advantage of the latest features in the most powerful Studio ever released.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-8 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 md:space-y-0 lg:grid-cols-3">
				<div>
					<div class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10 lg:size-12">
						<!-- <svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 3a1 1 0 000 2v8a2 2 0 002 2h2.586l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 15.414l2.293 2.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L12.414 15H15a2 2 0 002-2V5a1 1 0 100-2H3zm11.707 4.707a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 9.586 8.707 8.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 0l-2 2a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L8 10.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> -->
						<!-- <svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2v-4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H7V6Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
							<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 11a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7Zm7.5 1a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0 5 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
							<path d="M10.5 14.5a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"></path>
						</svg> -->

						<svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><path d="M232,96a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H184V48a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,48V176a8,8,0,0,0,13,6.22L72,154V184a16,16,0,0,0,16,16h93.59L219,230.22a8,8,0,0,0,5,1.78,8,8,0,0,0,8-8Zm-42.55,89.78a8,8,0,0,0-5-1.78H88V152h80a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V96h32V207.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold">AI assistant</h3>
					<p class="text-pretty text-foreground/80">Use large language models to deliver faster, higher-quality translations by enabling LLMs as a translation provider.</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<div class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10 lg:size-12">
						<!-- <svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-3.957l1.818.78a3 3 0 002.364 0l5.508-2.361a11.026 11.026 0 01.25 3.762 1 1 0 01-.89.89 8.968 8.968 0 00-5.35 2.524 1 1 0 01-1.4 0zM6 18a1 1 0 001-1v-2.065a8.935 8.935 0 00-2-.712V17a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg> -->
						<!-- <svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7 3 3 0 0 0-3 3v2a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V9a5 5 0 1 1 10 0v7.083A2.919 2.919 0 0 1 14.083 19H14a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v1a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1a2 2 0 0 0 1.732-1h.351a4.917 4.917 0 0 0 4.83-4H19a3 3 0 0 0 3-3v-2a3 3 0 0 0-3-3 7 7 0 0 0-7-7Zm1.45 3.275a4 4 0 0 0-4.352.976 1 1 0 0 0 1.452 1.376 2.001 2.001 0 0 1 2.836-.067 1 1 0 1 0 1.386-1.442 4 4 0 0 0-1.321-.843Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
						</svg> -->

						<svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><path d="M224,128v24a16,16,0,0,1-16,16H48a16,16,0,0,1-16-16V128a16,16,0,0,1,16-16H208A16,16,0,0,1,224,128ZM208,40H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,56V80A16,16,0,0,0,48,96H208a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A16,16,0,0,0,208,40ZM152,208H136V192a8,8,0,0,0-16,0v16H104a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h16v16a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V224h16a8,8,0,0,0,0-16Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold">Manager view</h3>
					<p class="text-pretty text-foreground/80">Work with files and projects in a single, streamlined view, whether they’re stored in the cloud, on a server, or locally.</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<div class="mb-4 flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/10 lg:size-12">
						<!-- <svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6 6V5a3 3 0 013-3h2a3 3 0 013 3v1h2a2 2 0 012 2v3.57A22.952 22.952 0 0110 13a22.95 22.95 0 01-8-1.43V8a2 2 0 012-2h2zm2-1a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v1H8V5zm1 5a1 1 0 011-1h.01a1 1 0 110 2H10a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path><path d="M2 13.692V16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-2.308A24.974 24.974 0 0110 15c-2.796 0-5.487-.46-8-1.308z"></path></svg> -->
						<!-- <svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
							<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M13 11.15V4a1 1 0 1 0-2 0v7.15L8.78 8.374a1 1 0 1 0-1.56 1.25l4 5a1 1 0 0 0 1.56 0l4-5a1 1 0 1 0-1.56-1.25L13 11.15Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
							<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9.657 15.874 7.358 13H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2.358l-2.3 2.874a3 3 0 0 1-4.685 0ZM17 16a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h.01a1 1 0 1 0 0-2H17Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
						</svg> -->

						<svg class="size-5 text-accent lg:size-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><rect width="256" height="256" fill="none"></rect><path d="M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24Zm20,128a4.21,4.21,0,0,0,1.33-.22,8,8,0,0,1,5.34,15.08A20,20,0,0,1,128,148c0-8.85,4.77-15.23,9-20.87,3.77-5,7-9.38,7-15.13a16,16,0,0,0-32,0,8,8,0,0,1-16,0,32,32,0,0,1,64,0c0,11.07-5.66,18.63-10.2,24.71-3.6,4.81-5.8,7.93-5.8,11.29A4,4,0,0,0,148,152Zm36-32a8,8,0,0,1-8-8,48,48,0,0,0-96,0c0,11.9,6.71,20.5,13.82,29.6,7,8.92,14.18,18.15,14.18,30.4a20,20,0,0,0,34,14.29,8,8,0,1,1,11.19,11.42A36,36,0,0,1,92,172c0-6.74-5-13.14-10.79-20.55C73.54,141.63,64,129.41,64,112a64,64,0,0,1,128,0A8,8,0,0,1,184,120Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold">Screen reader</h3>
					<p class="text-pretty text-foreground/80">Improved accessibility with full support for JAWS and NVDA, making Studio 2024 the most inclusive, feature-rich CAT tool.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Tabs -->
	<section class="bg-background pt-16 pb-16 text-foreground md:pt-20 md:pb-20 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-24" data-theme="dots">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-8 lg:px-12">
			<!-- Pricing Cards -->
			<div id="pricingTabs" class="divide-y divide-foreground/10 rounded-lg border border-foreground/10 bg-card text-card-foreground lg:grid lg:grid-cols-3 lg:divide-x lg:divide-y-0">
				<div class="col-span-2 p-6 lg:p-8">
					<h3 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold">Add-ons and extras</h3>

					<ul class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(2,minmax(max-content,1fr))] text-center font-semibold text-foreground/80 md:grid-cols-[repeat(4,minmax(max-content,1fr))] md:rounded-lg" id="pricing-tabs" data-tabs-toggle="#pricing-tabs-content" data-tabs-active-classes="text-gray-900 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-600 dark:text-white" data-tabs-inactive-classes="bg-white hover:text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:text-white dark:bg-gray-700 dark:hover:bg-gray-600" role="tablist">
						<li class="w-full" role="presentation">
							<button id="language-weaver-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="language-weaver-content" aria-selected="true" data-tabs-target="#language-weaver-content" data-plan-target="#language-weaver-plan" class="inline-block w-full rounded-tl border border-r-0 border-b-0 border-foreground/10 p-4 md:rounded-l md:border-b">Language Weaver</button>
						</li>
						<li class="w-full" role="presentation">
							<button id="cohere-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="cohere-content" aria-selected="false" data-tabs-target="#cohere-content" data-plan-target="#cohere-plan" class="inline-block w-full rounded-tr border border-b-0 border-foreground/10 p-4 md:rounded-tr-none md:border-r-0 md:border-b">Cohere</button>
						</li>
						<li class="w-full" role="presentation">
							<button id="standard-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="standard-content" aria-selected="false" data-tabs-target="#standard-content" data-plan-target="#standard-plan" class="inline-block w-full rounded-bl border border-r-0 border-foreground/10 p-4 md:rounded-bl-none">MultiTerm</button>
						</li>
						<li class="w-full" role="presentation">
							<button id="enterprise-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="enterprise-content" aria-selected="false" data-tabs-target="#enterprise-content" data-plan-target="#enterprise-plan" class="inline-block w-full rounded-br border border-foreground/10 p-4 md:rounded-r">Passolo</button>
						</li>
					</ul>

					<div id="pricing-tabs-content">
						<div id="language-weaver-content" class="hidden" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="language-weaver-tab">
							<div class="mt-8 mb-3 font-semibold md:text-xl">Language Weaver machine translation</div>

							<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground/80 md:prose-lg">
								<p>Providing real-time, instant translation to manage multilingual content and data. The Annual Language Weaver machine translation package offers unlimited documents, over 3,000 languages, 12 million characters, one user, one dictionary, and 12 months of API access.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div id="cohere-content" class="hidden" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="cohere-tab">
							<div class="mt-8 mb-3 font-semibold md:text-xl">Lorem ipsum dolor cohere</div>

							<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground/80 md:prose-lg">
								<p>Annual Cohere machine translation package offering unlimited documents, over 3,000 languages, 12 million characters, one user, one dictionary, and 12 months of API access. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div id="standard-content" class="hidden" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="standard-tab">
							<div class="mt-8 mb-3 font-semibold md:text-xl">Lorem ipsum dolor multiterm desktop</div>

							<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground/80 md:prose-lg">
								<p>Collaborate using our central terminology tool for consistent, high-quality content across departments and with translators.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div id="enterprise-content" class="hidden" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="enterprise-tab">
							<div class="mt-8 mb-3 font-semibold md:text-xl">Lorem ipsum dolor passolo translator</div>

							<div class="prose font-medium text-foreground/80 md:prose-lg">
								<p>Free editing tool for translation packages from Team or Collaboration editions, offering production features and integration.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="relative flex bg-foreground/2 p-6 lg:p-8">
					<div id="language-weaver-plan" class="hidden w-full self-center">
						<div class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Language Weaver MT subscription for translators</div>
						<div class="font-medium">Starts at</div>
						<div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center text-5xl font-bold">
